	(text "DRAFT / NOT FOR ORDER / NO FIRE\nLOCAL TFT RESET REVIEW - NOT INTEGRATED\nU302: TFT_3V3 supply + SENSE; RESET -> module RST only.\nMR open: internal pull-up. CT open: 12...28 ms (20 ms typ).\nR303 = RC0603FR-07100KL; C305 = GRM188R71E104KA01D.\nPWR_FLAG declares EXTERNAL test supply / return, not board integration.\nNO connection to ESP32 EN, safety RESET, or a GPIO.\nFirmware reinitialization after TFT-only power loss remains OPEN.\nTFT cable load / voltage thresholds / SPI backfeed remain unqualified."
